    <tags>batly logitech battery tray mouse keyboard headset hidpp foss</tags>
    <summary>Battery level of Logitech (and other wireless) devices in the Windows notification area.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Batly shows the battery level of Logitech mice, keyboards and headsets (HID++ receivers, Bluetooth, G HUB) and of other wireless devices in the Windows notification area, with low battery notifications and a local HTTP API.

A single small native executable written in Rust: no .NET runtime, no helper process.

**Note:** Batly installs per user (in `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\Batly`). Chocolatey usually runs elevated: the application is installed for the account that runs `choco install`.]]></description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
